      440.65,
      539.96,
      475.72
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that His Excellency the President has been pleased to appoint the following persons as Commissionersof the Mediation Boards Commission, with immediate effect, under the Provisions of Section 2(1) of the MediationBoards Act, No. 72 of 1988.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      88.05,
      488.65,
      424.1,
      547.72
    ],
    "text": "1.Justice Hector Yapa- Retired Judge of the Supreme Court2.Justice Nimal Dissanayake- Retired Judge of the Supreme Court3.Justice Chandradasa Nanayakkara- Retired Judge of the Court of Appeal4.Mr. M. Somasundaram5.Mrs. Faleela Be Jurangpathy",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      560.65,
      539.89,
      583.72
    ],
    "text": "His Excellency the President has nominated Justice Hector Yapa, retired Supreme Court Judge under the above-mentioned provisions, to be the Chairman of the said Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
